        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explode everyone as a Duck!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as vigilante driver Ducky Hardbeak, fully loaded with automatic weapons, rocket launchers and wise quacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/0025d287cfd21862dd99dbb80eb66b67.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/0025d287cfd21862dd99dbb80eb66b67.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=354 /></span><u><strong>Single Player and Multiplayer</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down and destroy anyone or anything in your way whether man, machine, or something else entirely (your friends).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/d22f4aa2364d582532c245d16d0b0593.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/d22f4aa2364d582532c245d16d0b0593.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=446 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Show a softer side?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up chicks and upgrades to defend the roost! Playable on both PC and VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/8233ee1b9b72956083bf06622d4ffe57.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/8233ee1b9b72956083bf06622d4ffe57.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=356 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Explode everyone as a Duck!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as vigilante driver Ducky Hardbeak, fully loaded with automatic weapons, rocket launchers and wise quacks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/0025d287cfd21862dd99dbb80eb66b67.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/0025d287cfd21862dd99dbb80eb66b67.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=354 /></span><u><strong>Single Player and Multiplayer</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down and destroy anyone or anything in your way whether man, machine, or something else entirely (your friends).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/d22f4aa2364d582532c245d16d0b0593.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/d22f4aa2364d582532c245d16d0b0593.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=446 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Show a softer side?</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up chicks and upgrades to defend the roost! Playable on both PC and VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras/8233ee1b9b72956083bf06622d4ffe57.avif?t=1778557184\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867200/extras_big/8233ee1b9b72956083bf06622d4ffe57.avif?t=1778557184 width=800 height=356 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Hunt down criminals, escape from dinosaurs, pick up chicks, explode your pals in car deathmatch, and discover the mystery of Bang City's Mayor.",
